<title>USA: Walled Lake, Mich., schools yield 5.85 pct in 2022.</title>
<headline>Walled Lake, Mich., schools yield 5.85 pct in 2022.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
